+The backend strictly preserves the existing folder structure under `server/src/` (adding `server/src/scripts/` for operational CLI scripts such as Admin seeding):
+
+| Layer | Directory | Core Responsibility | Prohibited Actions |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| **Configuration** | `server/src/config/` | Database connection (`db.js`), environment validation (`env.js`). | Business logic, HTTP handling. |
+| **Constants** | `server/src/constants/` | Immutable domain enums: `roles.js`, `statuses.js` (user, mall, slot, booking, token states). | Stateful code, database imports. |
+| **Routes** | `server/src/routes/` | Express `Router` definitions, path mapping, middleware chaining (`authenticate`, `authorize`, rate limiters). | Direct `req`/`res` manipulation, database queries. |
+| **Middleware** | `server/src/middleware/` | Cross-cutting HTTP pipeline steps: JWT verification, RBAC checks, CSRF/Origin checks, input validation, error handling. | Complex domain mutations. |
+| **Controllers** | `server/src/controllers/` | Extract `req.params`, `req.query`, `req.body`, `req.user`, `HttpOnly` cookies; invoke Service methods; set/clear cookies; return standardized JSON responses (`200`, `201`). | Direct `Model.find()`/`save()` calls, complex state machine transitions. |
+| **Services** | `server/src/services/` | Core domain logic, state machine enforcement, conditional atomic slot allocation, reconciliation, QR signing/verification, billing math, Mongoose queries. | Referencing `req` or `res` objects directly. |
